            "detailed_description": "<strong><i>Absence</i></strong> is a horror\\survival game that will make you question the people, <br>and things around you. <br><br>You've awakened in a bathroom, only knowing that someone has left to the main office to get you help.<br>Take a look around you, navigate through the area and meet your friend in the office.<br>There is a strange sense of something missing around you. <br><br>what were you doing there? where is <i>there</i>? <br>can you remember who you are? who's leaving you notes? <br>can you get to the main office? or out of the park?<br>will you find out what is missing? or will you go missing too?<br><br>&amp; on top of everything else, what is that noise...?",
